/**
 * True app icons as base64 PNGs — the real Student Platform logo as
 * square PNGs at exact sizes (14 Nov 2026).
 *
 * WHY THIS EXISTS: the manifest used to point at a Supabase file that was
 * declared image/png 192x192 and 512x512 but was actually a 1080x1173
 * JPEG photo. Chrome checks the real bytes: a type/size mismatch means
 * the app is NOT installable, so "Install app" never appeared in Chrome's
 * menu on Vivo and other Android phones. These are true PNGs, exact
 * square sizes, served by /api/app-icon.
 *
 * Binary files cannot be pushed to this repo with the tooling available
 * (the MCP push path is UTF-8 text only), so the bytes travel as text —
 * the same pattern as src/lib/fix-guide-image.ts. If real
 * public/icon-192.png / public/icon-512.png files are ever pushed
 * directly, /api/app-icon serves those instead.
 *
 * Each icon is an ARRAY of short strings joined at runtime — NOT one
 * long `+` chain. A 4,400-term concatenation nests the AST so deep the
 * build's parser can run out of stack ("Parsing error: Maximum call
 * stack size exceeded" killed the b125d21 deploy); a flat array parses
 * fine. Do not "simplify" these back into `+` chains.
 *
 * Source: the Student Platform logo (white circle, navy ring, graduation
 * cap, "STUDENT PLATFORM") on black. "any" icons fill the frame; the
 * maskable icon keeps the circle inside the central 80% safe zone so no
 * launcher mask ever clips the ring or the text.
 */

